WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Revise. Give the assistant only the checked state needed for a follow-up.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Compare. Inspect membership as well as the seven-to-four count change.

3
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Challenge. Demonstrate rejection of unknown layers, URLs and unsafe values.

4
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Reflect. Record evidence and disagreement without pretending to validate a health model.
